Chinese stroke data (runtime download only)
-------------------------------------------
`lib/hanzi.js` downloads per-character stroke data from
`hanzi-writer-data@2.0.1` on demand and caches it under the user's
`~/.dsh/scribble/hanzi/` directory. The data is not bundled in this package.

Source: https://github.com/chanind/hanzi-writer-data
Data originates from Arphic Technology Co., Ltd. and is licensed under the
Arphic Public License (ARPHICPL). Full license text:
https://github.com/chanind/hanzi-writer-data/blob/master/ARPHICPL.TXT

The plugin code that reads and renders this data is a separate work under
the MIT License. Downstream distributions that bundle the stroke data must
comply with the Arphic Public License, including its notice and
availability requirements.
